1
00:00:00,129 --> 00:00:02,009
(Leonard:)Come on, Raj, we're ready to start.

2
00:00:02,214 --> 00:00:05,464
(Raj:)We're ready when I say we're ready.

3
00:00:07,887 --> 00:00:09,387
Oop. Ahem.

4
00:00:09,597 --> 00:00:12,727
(Raj:)Okay. Now we're ready.

5
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:17,063
Ma, you wanna move your chair
over here so you can see?

6
00:00:17,271 --> 00:00:21,611
I'm fine where I am!
I don't wanna fall off the roof!

7
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:26,490
(Howard:)You'll fall through the roof
before you fall off it.

8
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,570
(Howard:)Penny?

9
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:37,628
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Your new mother-in-law
is a piece of work.

10
00:00:37,958 --> 00:00:39,418
(Bernadette:)Not now, Dad.

11
00:00:39,627 --> 00:00:41,627
(Mr Rostenkowski:)She's got a bigger mustache than me.

12
00:00:44,798 --> 00:00:46,508
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Here you go.

13
00:00:47,968 --> 00:00:57,018
(Bernadette:)Here you go? What am I, a football?

